text_en:
Where any person transfers or acquires all or part of the value-added telecommunications business or where a corporate value-added telecommunications business operator is merged with another corporation or comes into an inheritance, any of the following persons shall report thereon (including cases of reporting through information and telecommunications networks) to the Minister of Science and ICT, in accordance with the conditions and procedures prescribed by Presidential Decree; provided, the same shall not apply to a person deemed to have filed a report on the value-added telecommunications business under Article 22 (5) for reasons of the transfer or acquisition of all or part of the value-added telecommunications business or the merger or inheritance of a value-added telecommunications business operator which is a corporation: <Amended on May 19, 2011; Mar. 23, 2013; Oct. 15, 2014; Jul. 26, 2017; Dec. 24, 2018; Jan. 3, 2023; Mar. 18, 2025>
A person who acquires the relevant business;
A corporation that survives the merger or is established following the merger;
A person who inherits the relevant business.

