text_en:
Article 52-3 (Imposition of penalty surcharges on mobile communications business operators)
Where a mobile communications business operator (including their affiliate) or a mobile communications terminal device manufacturer violates Article 32-12 (1); 32-13 (2), (3) or (5); 32-14 (3); or 32-15 (2) or (3), the Korea Media and Communications Commission may impose a penalty surcharge on the mobile communications business operator (including their affiliate) or the mobile communications terminal device manufacturer in an amount not exceeding 3/100 of their sales as prescribed by Presidential Decree; provided, in cases where there is no sales or it is difficult to calculate the sales, as prescribed by Presidential Decree, a penalty surcharge not exceeding one billion won may be imposed. <Amended on Oct. 1, 2025>
Where an agent or a sales store of a mobile communications business operator violates Article 32-12 (1) or Article 32-15 (2) or (3), the Korea Media and Communications Commission may impose a penalty surcharge under paragraph (1) on the relevant mobile communications business operator; provided, the same shall not apply where the mobile communications business operator has not been negligent in giving due attention and supervision to prevent such violation. <Amended on Oct. 1, 2025>
In imposing a penalty surcharge under paragraph (1), the Korea Media and Communications Commission shall compute it based upon the following, and the detailed standard and procedures for computation thereof shall be prescribed by Presidential Decree: <Amended on Oct. 1, 2025>
Details and severity of the violation;
Duration and frequency of the violation;
Whether the violation has been committed intentionally or by negligence;
Scale of profits obtained from the violation;
Sales associated with the violation.
Where a person liable to pay a penalty surcharge prescribed in paragraph (1) or (2) fails to do so by a payment deadline, the Minister of Science and ICT or the Korea Media and Communications Commission shall collect 6/100 per annum of the penalty surcharge in arrears as an additional due from the day following the expiry of such payment deadline. <Amended on Mar. 23, 2013; Jul. 26, 2017; Oct. 1, 2025>
If a person liable to pay a penalty surcharge under paragraph (1) or (2) fails to pay it within the deadline for payment, the Korea Media and Communications Commission shall demand them to make payment within a fixed period, and if they fails to pay the penalty surcharge and the additional due prescribed in paragraph (4) within the fixed period, it shall collect them in the same manner as delinquent national taxes. <Amended on Oct. 1, 2025>
Where a penalty surcharge imposed under paragraph (1) or (2) is refunded by the decision of a court, etc., an additional payment on refund thereof equivalent to 6/100 per annum shall be paid for the period from the payment date of the penalty surcharge to the date it is refunded.
[This Article Added on Jan. 21, 2015]

