text_en:
Article 1 (Enforcement date)
This Act shall enter into force on the date of its promulgation; provided, among the statutes to be amended under Article 5 of the Addenda, any amendment made by this Act to a statute that was promulgated before this Act enters into force but whose enforcement date has yet to arrive shall enter into force on the enforcement date of that statute, and the amended provisions listed in the following subparagraphs shall enter into force on the respective dates specified therein:
The amended provisions listed in each of the following items shall enter into force on January 2, 2026; provided, among the statutes to be amended under Article 7 of the Addenda (limited to the portion related to the amended provisions of items (a) and (b)), any amendment made to a statute that was promulgated before the enforcement date specified in the main clause but whose enforcement date prescribed in the main clause has yet to arrive shall enter into force on the enforcement date of that statute;
(a)The amended provisions of Articles 19 (4), 23, 29 (1) 1, and 30;
(b)The amended provisions of Articles 12 (2), 19 (3), 22, and 29 (2) proviso (limited to the portion related to the Minister of Finance and Economy and the Ministry of Finance and Economy);
(c)Statutes to be amended under Article 7 of the Addenda (limited to the portion related to the amended provisions referred to in items (a) and (b));
Omitted.
Articles 2 through 6 Omitted.
Article 7 Omitted.
Article 8 Omitted.

